From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 13:56:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] KitKat UI P33: KitKat launcher icon for Messaging (P33.2)

Art from the CandyOS reference set (reference/icons/Messaging.png - the 4.4 Messaging icon). Part of P33: every built-in app drawer icon goes KitKat. The adaptive icon machinery (mipmap-anydpi/ic_launcher.xml plus the ic_launcher_background/foreground/monochrome drawables) is replaced by legacy full-bleed PNGs in every density bucket - the 4.4 launcher-icon behavior. Regenerated by scripts/candyos-gen-icons.py; sources live in the CandyOS repo under reference/.

Change-Id: I44aaf863b754486127f06828ebb0b2ede3349d18
---
 res/drawable/ic_launcher_background.xml |  18 -------------
 res/drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml |  34 ------------------------
 res/drawable/ic_launcher_monochrome.xml |  19 -------------
 res/mipmap-anydpi/ic_launcher.xml       |  10 -------
 res/mipmap-hdpi/ic_launcher.png         | Bin 0 -> 5194 bytes
 res/mipmap-mdpi/ic_launcher.png         | Bin 0 -> 2885 bytes
 res/mipmap-xhdpi/ic_launcher.png        | Bin 0 -> 7768 bytes
 res/mipmap-xxhdpi/ic_launcher.png       | Bin 0 -> 14050 bytes
 res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/ic_launcher.png      | Bin 0 -> 21789 bytes
 9 files changed, 81 deletions(-)
